        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Shela garmoó Yuda a Eri, inós gixsár Leka gana iimu/ún, nee La'ada, inós gixsár Maresha gana iimu/ún, múk hatlá' tlahhay'ín a kudá' tlabaá kitaánír tlehhahhitá', inooín awa gixsár Bet-ashbea, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Yokimu nee múk Koseba, nee Yoashi nee Sarafi, kuká' an mukdá' Moabu ngaa sawaawuti'ine nee nari ki/iyé' Lehemu. (Kaangwí oo iimír aáng.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí an kuduú tleuuse nee yaamuloouusér yaamaá Netaimu nee Gedera, inooín waawutmooín nguna sagadiyusiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Simeon a kwí: Nemueli nee Yamini, nee Yaribu nee Sera nee Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garmoó Saulo a Shalumu, nee Shalumu ina laqwaál Mibsamu, Mibsamu ina laqwaál Mishma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Mishma a kwí: Hamueli, inós ina laqwaál Sakuri, nee inós ina laqwaál Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimei daaqaay ngu kon a mibaá nee lahhoó', dasu a lahhoó', ala hhaeewós na/aá yaariir ngi kon'aaká, slám múk dooín ku ureeká adór múk doó Yuda wa alé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín gixsadaá taa hoót a kuká': Be'er-sheba, nee Molada, nee Hasar-shuali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Bilha, nee Esemu, nee Toladi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Betueli, nee Horma, nee Siklagi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Bet-makaboti, nee Hasar-susimu, nee Bet-biri, nee Sha'araimu. Gixsaduuká' an kudá' naa hootiyé' tam ay qoomár Daudi tawa waawutmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme tana hoót baraá gixsadaá hatlá' awa kooán, ar Etamu nee Aini, nee Rimoni, nee Tokeni, nee Ashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayeemooín sleémeero gixsaduká' kooán ngina harweeriyé' ay Ba'ali. Diirí an ayeemodá' taa hoót, nee tlahhi'i kaa gooín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
